\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 5.4 Crop Quality System\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is one of the central mechanics.\
Each planted crop has a numeric quality value.\uc0\u8232 Quality increases while favorable conditions are active.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Initial design rule\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 For each tick:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls25\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 if water is active on the tile, quality increases by 1\
\ls25\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 if fertilizer is active on the tile, quality increases by 1\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 If both are active, the crop gains both benefits during that tick.\
This means quality accumulation depends on care uptime, not just whether the player remembered to interact once.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f1\b\fs28 \cf0 Why this system is good\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 This approach is strong because it is:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls26\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 simple\
\ls26\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 data-driven\
\ls26\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 extensible\
\ls26\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 easy to balance\
\ls26\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 compatible with future higher-tier consumables\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Example future extension:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls27\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 normal fertilizer: +1 quality per second\
\ls27\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 premium fertilizer: +2 quality per second\
\ls27\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
